window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I don’t regret what I did. I’d do it again. But what happens now?</b><br> <br> The relic keeping the taint at bay has fractured and it’s all my fault. As the fractures grow, it’s only a matter of time before the taint breaks free.<br> <br> There’s only one solution. Find the Dagda and beg him to fix what I broke.<br> <br> I’m about to enter a race against time. If I fail, the world as we know it will pay the price<br> <br> A price we can’t afford.<br> <br> <b>Decisions have consequences and mine are about to bite me in the ass.</b></p>"; 
